## Verification Commands

| Command | Purpose |
| --- | --- |
| `${EDF_SCRIPTS}/run-tests.sh <ts\|p>` | Unit tests |
| `${EDF_SCRIPTS}/run-typecheck.sh <ts\|p>` | Type check |
| `${EDF_SCRIPTS}/run-lint.sh <ts\|p>` | Lint |
| `${EDF_SCRIPTS}/run-build.sh <ts\|p>` | Build |
| `${EDF_SCRIPTS}/run-e2e.sh <ts\|p>` | E2E tests |

## Path Conventions

- Test file convention: `tests/<area>/<unit>.test.ts` <!-- e.g. `.test.ts` or `test_<unit>.py` -->
- Source directory: `src/`
- Eval test path convention: `tests/eval/`

